  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;be a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;real matrix such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;is an identity matrix of order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>, then the system&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has"
